<title>POLAND: HUTA OLAWA NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>HUTA OLAWA NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.18 vs   0.25</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.31 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.18 vs   0.38</p>
<p> Sales		    4.00 vs   3.80</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.88 vs   2.85</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.03 vs   4.72</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.32 vs   4.32</p>
<p> Sales		   44.85 vs  38.53</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish non-ferrous metals smelter is</p>
<p>Huta Olawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
